Hi Christy,

After reading in a reference ply file, one has the ability to change the color component. It is found in the $material part of the ply object in R.  Try something like

Myply$material <- “gray”

and then continue the remaining downstream operations. The help page ?read.ply describes this process.

Additional information found in the help file of WarpRefMesh.

Best,

